- Dates read YYYY年M月D日, ISO and DD/MM/YYYY; impossible dates give None
- Amounts choose the decimal separator from the last separator or locale hint
- Tax ids are classified by shape and checked with python-stdnum
- Vector file regenerated by the module so it stays shared with TypeScript

